## Feature 4: Admissions & Enquiry Gateway

**Description:** Connecting parents to schools.

### Frontend User Stories
- **US4.1 (Parent) — Built:** As a parent, I want to ask a school about admissions (class, roughly when, my question) and continue the conversation in the app, and to apply with the Kidscover Standard form when I am ready.
- **US4.2 (Parent) — Built:** As a parent viewing a school, I want a link to its own website.
- **US4.3 (School Admin) — Built:** As a school admissions user, I want a dashboard of incoming enquiries and applications for my own school, and nothing from any other school.

### Backend User Stories
- **US4.4 (Backend) — Built:** As a system, I need to push the Kidscover Standard form to a partner school's CRM by webhook, signed with that school's secret, retried on failure, never following a redirect and never reaching a private address.
- **US4.5 (Backend) — Built:** As a system, I need to log outbound clicks to schools' own pages as counts, never as who clicked.
- **US4.6 (Backend) — Built:** As a system, I need enquiry limits (one open enquiry per school, 10 new a day, confirmed email) and no child data in an enquiry.

