## Feature 6: Parent Reviews & Moderation — Built

- **US6.1 (Parent) — Built:** As a parent, I want to write an anonymous review (rating, text, how I know the school), edit or delete it, and report others' reviews.
- **US6.2 (Kidscover Admin) — Built:** As a moderator, I want to publish or reject pending reviews and handle reports, so only fair reviews show.
- **US6.3 (Backend) — Built:** As a system, I need one review per parent per school, pending until published, and a confirmed email to write or report.

