## Feature 7: School Data from School Websites — Built

- **US7.1 (Kidscover Admin) — Built:** As an admin, I want the system to read each school's own website and suggest its board, levels, admission status, facilities and claimed achievements, each with the sentence and page it came from.
- **US7.2 (Kidscover Admin) — Built:** As an admin, I want to accept or reject each suggestion (strong ones ticked, weak ones not), and accept CBSE boards confirmed by CBSE's record in bulk.
- **US7.3 (Backend) — Built:** As a system, I need to read politely (robots.txt, a few pages, size and time limits), safely (no private addresses by name or by the address they resolve to, redirects re-checked), and in English, Marathi and Hindi; to confirm CBSE affiliation numbers against CBSE's record; and never to overwrite what a school entered itself.
- **US7.4 (Parent) — Built:** As a parent, I want to see where each fact came from and when it was checked.

