## Feature 9: Categories — Built

- **US9.1 (Kidscover Admin) — Built:** As an admin, I want to see which places the rules put in After-school classes, Colleges or Hidden (with the reason), and move any single place with one click.
- **US9.2 (Parent) — Built:** As a parent, I want After-school classes and Colleges as separate lists, one tap away, with filters that make sense for each.

