## Feature 10: Fees and the True Cost of a Year — Built

- **US10.1 (Parent) — Built:** As a parent, I want to see what a year at a school really costs — everything in the first year, and every year after — so that I can compare schools honestly.
- **US10.2 (Parent) — Built:** As a parent, I want the breakdown (tuition, bus, meals, uniform, activities, one-time fees) and to know where the numbers came from.
- **US10.3 (Parent) — Built:** As a parent, I want to filter by what my family can spend and sort by lowest cost, and to decide whether schools with no fees listed are shown.
- **US10.4 (School Admin) — Built:** As a school's staff member, I want to give our fees per level and year, with a note for things like a sibling discount.

