## Feature 12: Notifications — Built

- **US12.1 (Parent) — Built:** As a parent, I want my phone to tell me when a school replies or my application moves on, in my own language, without putting anything private on my lock screen.
- **US12.2 (Parent) — Built:** As a parent, I want to switch notifications off.

