**92% built** counting whole stories; **95%** if the four partly-built ones count for half. Every story not fully
built belongs to Feature 1 (sign-in and personalisation) except one, and none of them blocks a parent from finding a
school, asking about it, applying to it or hearing back.

What is left is listed in PRD §9. The nearest thing to a gap that matters is not a story at all: the second phase is
merged but needs its migrations run and its functions deployed before a parent sees any of it (PRD §8).
